    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University is proud to announce the appointment of Dr Tashmin Khamis, the Founding Director of AKU's Networks of Quality Assurance and Improvement (QAI_net) and Teaching and Learning (TL_net), as a member of the international judging panel for the UK-based Higher Education Academy's Global Teaching Excellence Award.",
